lic reshape planning endpoint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": "Project rules, planning endpoint", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "src/routes/api/public/reshape.ts is public, CORS-open and input-size-capped so extensions can call it from any site; planning logic resides in src/server/reshape.server.ts."}, {"id": "agents_openrouter_planning", "label": "OpenRouter strict JSON planning", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": "Project rules, OpenRouter", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Server-side chat completions use OPENROUTER_API_KEY and strict JSON schema validation; no alternate provider fallback is permitted when the key is missing, keeping selection and billing predictable."}, {"id": "agents_pagewright_operations_tests", "label": "Pagewright operation tests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": "Project rules, globalThis.Pagewright", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "extension/pagewright.js exposes globalThis.Pagewright; sorting, date and filtering logic is tested in src/test/pagewright-ops.test.ts."}, {"id": "agents_shared_configs", "label": "Public shared configurations", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": "Project rules, community sharing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_server_owned_sharing", "label": "Server-owned authenticated sharing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": "Project rules, community sharing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "public.shared_configs is publicly readable; only public configs APIs write through the admin client after shape/size validation. The server verifies